  "label": "Misogynous Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that women are objectified and reduced to body parts, particularly genitalia, and that their sexual availability or submission is a central aspect of their value or desirability. The phrase 'beat dat pussy into mashed potatoes' is a hypersexualized and violent metaphor that objectifies the woman and reduces her to a body part, reinforcing the harmful normalization of such attitudes.",
